You may not decompile, disassemble, or otherwise reverse engineer the executable files of the software, and you may not try to rebuild their source code, in whole or in part.  You may not ask or allow anyone else to do it for you.

## AI Agents and Automated Tools

Anything an AI agent, AI model, or other automated tool does with the software on your behalf or at your direction counts as done by you, and these terms apply to it exactly as they apply to you.  You may not use such a tool to do anything these terms forbid you to do yourself, including reverse engineering the executable files or publishing any part of the software.

